#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Primitives were created to simplify the most common tasks for quantum computers: namely, sampling quantum states and calculating expectation values. The first Qiskit Runtime primitives ([`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2) and [`SamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2)) are implementations of the Qiskit [primitives base classes](/guides/primitives). They provide a more sophisticated implementation (for example, by including error mitigation) as a cloud-based service and are used to access IBM Quantum&reg; hardware.\n"
msgid "Primitives were created to simplify the most common tasks for quantum computers: namely, sampling quantum states and calculating expectation values. The first IBM Quantum primitives ([`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2) and [`SamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2)) are implementations of the Qiskit [primitives base classes](/guides/primitives). They provide a more sophisticated implementation (for example, by including error mitigation) as a cloud-based service and are used to access IBM Quantum&reg; hardware.\n"
msgstr "Primitives는 양자 컴퓨터의 가장 일반적인 작업인 양자 상태 샘플링과 기댓값 계산을 단순화하기 위해 만들어졌습니다. 첫 번째 Qiskit Runtime Primitives([`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2) 및 [`SamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2))는 Qiskit [Primitives 기본 클래스](/guides/primitives)의 구현체입니다. 이들은 클라우드 기반 서비스로 더 정교한 구현(예: 오류 완화 포함)을 제공하며 IBM Quantum&reg; 하드웨어에 접근하는 데 사용됩니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The newest IBM Quantum primitive, [Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor) (which is in beta), provides a lower-level interface that gives more visibility and control without sacrificing performance. \n"
"`Executor` also exposes **additional capabilities that Sampler does not offer**, such as additional twirling groups and twirling for circuits with fractional gates. Refer to [Migrate from Sampler to Executor](/guides/migrate-from-sampler-to-executor) for more information on whether to migrate to `Executor`. \n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Estimator\"\n"
"      description=\"Computes the expectation values for one or more observables with respect to states prepared by quantum circuits.  Has built-in error suppression and mitigation methods.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-estimator\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Estimator\"\n"
"      description=\"양자 Circuit으로 준비된 상태에 대해 하나 이상의 Observable의 기댓값을 계산합니다. 내장된 오류 억제 및 완화 방법이 있습니다.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-estimator\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Estimator 빠른 시작\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sampler\"\n"
"      description=\"Samples the output register from the execution of one or more quantum circuits.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-sampler\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sampler\"\n"
"      description=\"하나 이상의 양자 Circuit 실행에서 출력 레지스터를 샘플링합니다.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-sampler\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Sampler 빠른 시작\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <Card\n"
"      title=\"Executor (beta)\"\n"
"      description=\"Samples output registers from quantum circuit executions based on input directives and gives you full control and transparency over customizing error mitigation methods.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-executor\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <Card\n"
"      title=\"Executor (베타)\"\n"
"      description=\"입력 지시에 따라 양자 Circuit 실행에서 출력 레지스터를 샘플링하며 오류 완화 방법 사용자 정의에 대한 완전한 제어와 투명성을 제공합니다.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-executor\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Executor 빠른 시작\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"

